    "text": "By Anne Paxton ,\n11 hours ago A restaurant employee working the counter on Edgewood Avenue lost more than a few minutes of convenience Monday, August 31 — someone grabbed her cell phone right off the cashier's stand and bolted out the door before anyone could react. Now the Jacksonville Sheriff's Office wants the public's help putting a name to the face caught on the shop's surveillance footage. Read full article",
